---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout title={SITE.title} description="Gilberto Taccari | Engineering leader • CTO • Fintech">
  <h1 class="page-heading">Gilberto Taccari</h1>

  <p>Engineering leader • CTO • Fintech</p>

  <p>
    Building engineering teams and fintech platforms for regulated, high-growth
    startups and scaleups.
  </p>

  <hr />

  <section>
    <h2>About</h2>

    <p>
      I began my career as a software engineer, building trading platforms and banking
      systems, which provided a robust foundation for regulated, high-stakes
      applications. I then moved into technical leadership within the fintech startup
      ecosystem, first as a tech lead at Penta (acquired by Qonto) and later as a
      co-founder and Head of Technology at faire.ai, where I built an AI-powered
      credit-scoring platform.
    </p>

    <p>
      At Tot., my work as CTO focuses on three priorities: expanding engineering teams
      to address real-world challenges, developing scalable systems to avoid technical
      debt, and integrating AI into development workflows to enable rapid delivery. My
      approach is informed by analytical discipline gained through a PhD in Computer
      Engineering and academic research.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Experience</h2>

    <p>
      <strong>Chief Technology Officer,</strong> Tot., Milano. <em>Nov 2023–present</em>.<br />
      Leading technical strategy and building the engineering team during high growth.
      Driving an AI-native culture by implementing LLM-based workflows to increase
      velocity.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Head of Technology & Co-Founder,</strong> faire.ai, Milano. <em>Oct 2020–Oct 2023</em>.<br />
      Co-founded the company and expanded the technical team from 0 to 10+ people,
      including engineers and data scientists. Delivered an AI-powered credit scoring
      platform that secured €1.5M pre-seed and €3M seed funding.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Tech Lead,</strong> Penta (acquired by Qonto), Milano. <em>Jul 2019–Sep 2020</em>.<br />
      Led a distributed cross-functional team to streamline Know Your Customer (KYC)
      and Know Your Business (KYB) processes for Italian and German clients, boosting
      user experience alongside ensuring regulatory compliance.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Lead Backend Engineer,</strong> Infinitec Solutions, Milano. <em>Aug 2018–Jun 2019</em>.<br />
      Led a distributed team of senior engineers and external consultants responsible
      for the open banking module of the company’s API platform. Oversaw API design
      decisions to maintain conformity to style and quality standards.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Senior Backend Engineer,</strong> Finleap, Milano. <em>Nov 2017–Jul 2018</em>.<br />
      Developed RESTful microservices for Infinitec Solutions’ B2B platform,
      supporting SMEs in financial management.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Software Engineer,</strong> Par-Tec, Milano. <em>Apr 2015–Oct 2017.</em><br />
      Provided IT consulting to major Italian banks and insurance companies, working
      on projects ranging from online trading platforms to insurance claims management
      systems.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Ventures</h2>

    <h3>Tot</h3>
    <p>
      Tot. is an Italian startup redefining SME financial management. As CTO, I lead
      engineering strategy and team growth, supported by €7M in pre-series A funding.
    </p>

    <h3>faire.ai</h3>
    <p>
      faire.ai provides an AI and Open Banking API platform for automated credit
      scoring. As co-founder and Head of Technology, I built the platform and team,
      securing €3M in seed funding and partnerships with Fabrick and Mia-Platform.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Skills</h2>
    <ul role="list">
      <li>Fintech & Regulated Systems</li>
      <li>Platform Architecture</li>
      <li>Engineering Leadership & Team Building</li>
      <li>Open Banking & API Strategy</li>
      <li>Cloud-Native & Infrastructure</li>
      <li>AI/LLM Engineering</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Open to discussions about fintech, engineering leadership, and AI. Contact by
      email or connect on LinkedIn.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
